<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on ABB AG.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on ABB AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued five million American-style call warrants, on ABB AG bearer shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,750.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	9.36 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.97 CHF		  GEARING	11.69 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   15.MAY.98		 PAYDATE	29.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 50</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,736.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
